et-包","content":"依赖平台原生 `.node`，同样从 `native/` 搜索路径加载。","locale":"zh"},"254":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#sdk-包","content":"`@snowluma/sdk` 是面向第三方的类型完备 OneBot 客户端，可独立发布到 npm、不依赖 SnowLuma 运行时。它在 monorepo 里构建（见下方 `pnpm build:sdk` / `build:all`），消费侧用法见 SDK 文档。","locale":"zh"},"255":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#构建顺序","content":"完整发行版：","locale":"zh"},"256":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#构建顺序","content":"依次执行：","locale":"zh"},"257":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#构建顺序","content":"`@snowluma/core` 完整构建","locale":"zh"},"258":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#构建顺序","content":"`@snowluma/sdk`","locale":"zh"},"259":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#构建顺序","content":"`webui`","locale":"zh"},"260":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#构建顺序","content":"产物统一输出到 `dist/`。","locale":"zh"},"261":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#文档站","content":"文档站在独立仓库 `SnowLuma/SnowLumaDocs`（本地一般 checkout 到 `dev/SnowLumaDocs/`，与主仓共存）。","locale":"zh"},"262":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#文档站","content":"技术栈：Rspress + React + TypeScript + MDX + KaTeX。","locale":"zh"},"263":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#文档站","content":"OneBot API 参考由文档仓的 `pnpm api:generate`（已挂到 `prebuild`）从 `docs/public/api/catalog.json` 生成——每个动作一页（外加分类概览页与可搜索的目录落地页）。`catalog.json` 是主仓 `collectActionDocs()` 产出的 action 目录（与 `@snowluma/mcp` 的 `CatalogAction` 同构），由主仓的 `sync-docs-catalog` workflow 在发布时用 SnowLuma bot 自动提交到文档仓——无需手动维护。","locale":"zh"},"264":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#贡献注意事项","content":"**不要绕过 BridgeManager**：OneBot 层一律通过 `BridgeInterface` 调用 NTQQ 能力，便于解耦和测试。","locale":"zh"},"265":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#贡献注意事项","content":"**保持配置可自动生成**：新增字段需向后兼容；解析时归一化、写回磁盘。","locale":"zh"},"266":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#贡献注意事项","content":"**原生模块按平台分发**：新加平台时同步 `.node` 与可注入库。","locale":"zh"},"267":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#贡献注意事项","content":"**优先补测试**：核心 OneBot 行为通过 `vitest` 验证，参考 `packages/core/tests/`。","locale":"zh"},"268":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/developer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/developer#贡献注意事项","content":"**API 文档自动化**：用 `defineAction` 新增动作（可选 `returnsSchema` 描述 `data`）即可——`catalog.json` 由 `sync-docs-catalog` workflow 自动同步，API 参考不会过时；本地预览可手动 `pnpm api:generate`。","locale":"zh"},"269":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/faq","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/faq","type":"page","content":"排障","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/faq","locale":"zh"},"270":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/faq-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/faq","content":"扫码、密码、端口、注入、镜像拉取的常见失败","locale":"zh"},"271":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/faq-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/faq","type":"head