"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#登录与首次访问","content":"**扫码登录**：SnowLuma **只支持扫码登录**，没有 CLI 登录。在无头环境里必须通过 VNC / noVNC 看到 QQ 窗口才能扫码。","locale":"zh"},"402":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#登录与首次访问","content":"**找 WebUI 临时密码**：**首次**用全新数据目录启动时，日志里会打印一次性管理员密码。Docker：","locale":"zh"},"403":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#登录与首次访问","content":"临时密码只在全新数据目录首次启动时输出一次，重启或复用旧数据不会重新生成。","locale":"zh"},"404":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#登录与首次访问","content":"**开放端口**：要从外部访问，放行 WebUI（`5099`）和你用到的 OneBot 端口（`3000` / `3001`）。","locale":"zh"},"405":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#登录与首次访问","content":"**不要**把 noVNC / WebUI / OneBot 端口裸暴露在公网。远程桌面没有固定默认密码，看容器日志即可。","locale":"zh"},"406":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"每次手输密码很烦？WebUI 支持在地址里带上**登录密码**直接进入：","locale":"zh"},"407":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"参数名是 `token`，**值就是你平时登录 WebUI 的密码**。SnowLuma 会用它走登录接口，密码正确即直达主页。","locale":"zh"},"408":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"**用后即清**：密码读取后会**立即从地址栏移除**（`history.replaceState`），避免经浏览器历史 / 访问日志 / Referer 头泄露。","locale":"zh"},"409":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"服务端照常校验，密码错误只会退回登录页，不存在绕过。","locale":"zh"},"410":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"密码出现在 URL 里**风险较高**（会进浏览器历史、可能被中间设备 / 代理记录）。仅建议在可信的本地 / 内网环境使用；不要分享带密码的链接、不要贴进聊天 / issue、不要在公共设备上用。","locale":"zh"},"411":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#接下来","content":"选择部署方式 —— 各路径详细对比。","locale":"zh"},"412":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#接下来","content":"配置参考 —— 改端口、access token、适配器。","locale":"zh"},"413":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#接下来","content":"更新 —— 升级而不丢登录态。","locale":"zh"},"414":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","type":"page","content":"动作发现与结果","breadcrumbs":["Docs","MCP"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","locale":"zh"},"415":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","content":"搜索动作、读取返回结构、检查环境，并追踪调用结果","locale":"zh"},"416":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#搜索和分页","content":"搜索和分页","locale":"zh"},"417":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#参数返回结构与示例","content":"参数、返回结构与示例","locale":"zh"},"418":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#读取结构化结果","content":"读取结构化结果","locale":"zh"},"419":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#环境概览","content":"环境概览","locale":"zh"},"420":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#缓存与追踪","content":"缓存与追踪","locale":"zh"},"421":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#搜索和分页","content":"`search_actions` 默认保持不区分大小写的子串匹配和目录顺序。下面是传给工具的参数：","locale":"zh"},"422":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#搜索和分页","content":"`keywords` 模式要求空格分隔的各关键词都匹配，支持一组常见中英文同义词，完整动作名或别名优先。它不是任意语义搜索。","locale":"zh"},"423":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#搜索和分页","content":"`list_actions` 和 `search_actions` 都支持 `category`、`read_only`、`stream`、`limit`（1–200）和 `offset`（非负整数）。不传分页参数时保持 `{ count, actions }`；传入后还返回匹配总数 `total` 和下一页 `next_offset`，末页为 `null`。这些操作只查询包内目录。","locale":"zh"},"424":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#参数返回结构与示例","content":"调用 `get_action({ \"name\": \"get_msg\" })` 可读取 `inputSchema`、`returnsSchema`、约束和 `examples`。示例里的账号、群、消息标识和路径必须替换为当前会话的真实值。","locale":"zh"},"425":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#参数返回结构与示例","content":"`returnsSchema` 描述成功响应的 &#x2A;*OneBot `data`**，不是整个响应信封，也不是 MCP 的包装结构。流式动作描述的是单帧数据；MCP 的下载结果则是保存后的文件信息。未实现动作和兼容占位行为会明确标注。","locale":"zh"},"426":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#参数返回结构与示例","content":"普通消息编号是非零的有符号 32 位整数，负值合法。例如下面是 `query_action` 的参数：","locale":"zh"},"427":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#参数返回结构与示例","content":"不要取绝对值或把负值改为零；也不要把十进制字符串形式的大小、标识或 `null` 擅自改成其他类型。","locale":"zh"},"428":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#读取结构化结果","content":"完成的工具调用保留原有 `content` 文本，并增加 `structuredContent`：","locale":"zh"},"429":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#读取结构化结果","content":"`result` 是原始结果；目录工具可以返回数组或索引，不能总按 OneBot 响应解析。MCP 工具错误的 `result` 为 `null`。`diagnostics.outcome` 为 `success`、`failed` 或 `unknown`，失败时可带 `kind`、`message`、`next_step`。","locale":"zh"},"430":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#读取结构化结果","content":"普通 OneBot 业务失败保留原始信封，不设置 `isError`，因此 **仅检查 `isError` 不够**。异步受理或尚未确认的结果会标为 `unknown`。传输错误、参数错误和流式协议错误设置 `isError: true`。","locale":"zh"},"431":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#读取结构化结果","content":"新版协议的 `input_required` 和 `task` 是继续处理的状态。先检查 `resultType`，完成补充输入或查询任务后再读取最终结果。","locale":"zh"},"432":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#环境概览","content":"`get_runtime_info({})` 默认不联网，返回实际模式、执行和写入是否启用、目录版本，以及执行模式下的传输限制、下载目录和上传根目录。端点和令牌不会出现在概览中。`server_support: \"unknown\"`、`connection_checked: false` 不能解读为已连接或已登录。","locale":"zh"},"433":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#环境概览","content":"显式传入下面参数，会执行三项只读查询：`get_login_info`、`get_status`、`get_version_info`。","locale":"zh"},"434":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#环境概览","content":"此检查仅在读/写模式可用；各项原始响应与诊断保留在 `checks` 中。部分失败仍然可见，HTTP 成功也不等于账号在线。","locale":"zh"},"435":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#缓存与追踪","content":"新版客户端可缓存静态发现信息：工具列表和静态资源列表提供五分钟的私有缓存提示，完整目录和预览界面资源提供五分钟的公共缓存提示。启用事件后资源列表不缓存，账号事件资源不缓存，工具执行结果不提供缓存提示。旧客户端不收到新版专属缓存字段。","locale":"zh"},"436":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#缓存与追踪","content":"每次工具调用都会产生追踪标识，并通过结果的 `_meta.traceparent` 返回。调用者也可在请求 `_meta` 中提供合法的 `traceparent` 和可选 `tracestate`，与上游调用关联。追踪信息通过 HTTP 请求头传递，不混入动作参数。","locale":"zh"},"437":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/actions#缓存与追踪","content":"在 SnowLuma 开启 TRACE 日志后，用同一 `traceparent` 找到 `http_trace`，再沿日志中的请求编号排查。MCP 日志记录工具、结果、耗时和错误类别，不记录正文或令牌。追踪不是权限凭据，也不会自动上传遥测。","locale":"zh"},"438":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","type":"page","content":"实时事件订阅","breadcrumbs":["Docs","MCP"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","locale":"zh"},"439":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","content":"按账号和会话筛选 OneBot 事件，通过资源通知和游标增量读取","locale":"zh"},"440":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#配置事件连接","content":"配置事件连接","locale":"zh"},"441":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#创建订阅","content":"创建订阅","locale":"zh"},"442":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#读取事件","content":"读取事件","locale":"zh"},"443":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#接收更新通知","content":"接收更新通知","locale":"zh"},"444":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#缓冲断线与缺口","content":"缓冲、断线与缺口","locale":"zh"},"445":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#配置事件连接","content":"读或写模式下设置 `SNOWLUMA_MCP_EVENTS_URL`，例如 `ws://127.0.0.1:3001/event`。这是 OneBot 的事件地址，不是 MCP 地址，也不是 WebUI 地址。它与 HTTP 端点分别配置，使用同一个 `SNOWLUMA_MCP_TOKEN` 授权请求头。","locale":"zh"},"446":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#配置事件连接","content":"只允许 `ws:` / `wss:`，不能带内嵌用户名、密码、查询参数或片段。列出工具、资源不会联网；调用 `subscribe_events` 才会建立连接。文档模式不会连接事件源。","locale":"zh"},"447":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#创建订阅","content":"先通过 `get_login_info` 等方式确认预期账号，再向 `subscribe_events` 传入：","locale":"zh"},"448":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#创建订阅","content":"这里的账号和会话编号都是示例。`self_id` 必填，必须与连接收到的事件账号一致；不一致会停止连接并报错。一个 MCP 连接内的资源共享一个账号的事件源。","locale":"zh"},"449":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#创建订阅","content":"`types` 可选 `message`、`notice`、`request`，省略表示三类都收。`message_sent` 归入消息类。群和用户筛选按 AND 组合：同时提供时，两者都必须匹配。群筛选会排除没有 `group_id` 的私聊等事件。每组编号过滤器最多 100 个不同的正安全整数。","locale":"zh"},"450":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#读取事件","content":"成功结果的 `structuredContent.result.uri` 是订阅资源地址，形式为 `snowluma://onebot/events/<id>`。向 `resources/read` 传入真实地址：","locale":"zh"},"451":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#读取事件","content":"资源的 `contents[].text` 是 JSON，包含 `status`、`events`、`next_cursor`、`oldest_cursor`、`dropped_events`、`gap` 和 `notification_failed`。保存 `next_cursor`，下次把它放入同一资源 URI 的 `?after=` 中，只读取更新的事件：","locale":"zh"},"452":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#读取事件","content":"游标属于单个资源，不能跨资源复用。读取不消费事件；这里只保留创建订阅后的实时事件，不是消息历史查询。","locale":"zh"},"453":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#接收更新通知","content":"新版客户端通过 `subscriptions/listen` 订阅资源更新；TypeScript 客户端使用 `client.listen({ resourceSubscriptions: [uri] })`。","locale":"zh"},"454":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#接收更新通知","content":"旧客户端先调用 `resources/subscribe`，再接收 `notifications/resources/updated`。","locale":"zh"},"455":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#接收更新通知","content":"通知只表示资源发生变化，收到后需要重新读取内容。&#x2A;*订阅通知时必须使用不带 `?after` 的原始资源 URI。**","locale":"zh"},"456":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#接收更新通知","content":"停止新版通知流不会释放事件缓存。两代客户端都可调用工具 `unsubscribe_events`，参数为 `{ \"uri\": \"实际资源地址\" }`；旧版 `resources/unsubscribe` 也会释放该资源。最后一个资源释放后关闭 WebSocket，MCP 连接结束时释放其所有事件资源。","locale":"zh"},"457":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#缓冲断线与缺口","content":"每个资源最多保留 256 条事件和 1 MiB 数据，一个运行连接最多 16 个资源，单帧上限 256 KiB。慢消费者可能遇到旧事件被淘汰；应检查 `gap`、`dropped_events` 和 `oldest_cursor`，不能把当前队列当成完整记录。","locale":"zh"},"458":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#缓冲断线与缺口","content":"连接失败、账号不符、格式错误或断线会显式反映在状态或错误中，不会静默重连。断线后重建或切换账号前，先释放已有资源；重新订阅不恢复缺失事件。通知发送失败会通过 `notification_failed` 表明。","locale":"zh"},"459":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/events#缓冲断线与缺口","content":"事件订阅本身不执行 OneBot 业务动作，也不发送 QQ 消息。客户端后续如何回复，仍由调用方工作流决定。","locale":"zh"},"460":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"page","content":"MCP 使用","breadcrumbs":["Docs","MCP"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp","locale":"zh"},"461":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp","content":"配置 SnowLuma MCP，查询动作、执行请求，并按需启用后台任务和事件订阅","locale":"zh"},"462":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"工作模式","locale":"zh"},"463":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp#准备","content":"准备","locale":"zh"},"464":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"文档模式","locale":"zh"},"465":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp#连接到-snowluma","content":"连接到 SnowLuma","locale":"zh"},"466":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp#开启写模式","content":"开启写模式","locale":"zh"},"467":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"环境变量","locale":"zh"},"468":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"使用建议","locale":"zh"},"469":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp#安全边界","content":"安全边界","locale":"zh"},"470":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp","content":"`@snowluma/mcp` 通过 stdio 把 SnowLuma 的 OneBot 动作目录和可选执行能力接入 AI 客户端。原有工具、参数、文本结果和读写权限保持兼容；支持新版能力的客户端还可以使用补充输入、后台任务、事件订阅和消息预览面板。","locale":"zh"},"471":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp","content":"本节按当前开发分支维护。新能力需要包含对应更新的包；源码更新不代表 npm 包已经发布，请核对实际安装版本。目录是随包提供的快照，不代表连接的服务端支持其中所有动作。","locale":"zh"},"472":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"模式","locale":"zh"},"473":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"何时启用","locale":"zh"},"474":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"能做什么","locale":"zh"},"475":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"`docs`","locale":"zh"},"476":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"未配置端点，或显式选择文档模式","locale":"zh"},"477":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"查询目录、查看本地环境概览、生成消息草稿；不访问运行中的 SnowLuma。","locale":"zh"},"478":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"`read`","locale":"zh"},"479":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"配置端点后的默认模式","locale":"zh"},"480":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"增加明确标记为只读的动作；配置事件地址后可以订阅事件。","locale":"zh"},"481":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"`write`","locale":"zh"},"482":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"显式设置 `SNOWLUMA_MCP_MODE=write`","locale":"zh"},"483":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"增加写动作、流式传输；配置任务目录且客户端支持时可以创建后台任务。","locale":"zh"},"484":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#工作模式","content":"只读属性来自动作定义，不能仅凭 `get_` 等名称前缀判断。即使绕过工具列表直接调用，服务端也会检查模式。所有流式动作目前都要求写模式，包括下载。","locale":"zh"},"485":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#准备","content":"一个支持 stdio MCP 服务的客户端。","locale":"zh"},"486":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#准备","content":"当前包要求 Node.js `^24.22.1 || >=26.12.1`，客户端能运行 `node` 或 `npx`。","locale":"zh"},"487":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#准备","content":"执行动作需要已配置的 **OneBot HTTP 端点**，例如 `http://127.0.0.1:3000/`；WebUI 的管理端口不能替代它。","locale":"zh"},"488":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#准备","content":"事件订阅另外需要 OneBot WebSocket 事件地址，不能从 HTTP 端口猜测。","locale":"zh"},"489":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#准备","content":"同一命令支持 MCP `2026-07-28` 的发现机制和旧客户端的初始化流程，无需为旧客户端更换启动方式。高级能力是否可用还取决于客户端声明的支持情况；这里不会启动对外监听的 MCP HTTP 服务。","locale":"zh"},"490":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"下面是使用 `mcpServers` 配置格式的客户端示例，其他客户端请使用其等价配置：","locale":"zh"},"491":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"工具","locale":"zh"},"492":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"说明","locale":"zh"},"493":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"`list_actions`","locale":"zh"},"494":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"按分类、读写属性、流式属性筛选，可分页。","locale":"zh"},"495":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"`search_actions`","locale":"zh"},"496":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"默认子串匹配，可显式开启多关键词与常用中英文同义词匹配。","locale":"zh"},"497":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"`get_action`","locale":"zh"},"498":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"参数、约束、返回数据结构和调用示例，支持别名。","locale":"zh"},"499":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"`list_categories`","locale":"zh"},"500":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"分类及动作数量。","locale":"zh"},"501":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"`get_runtime_info`","locale":"zh"},"502":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"默认只查看本地配置；主动检查连接需执行模式。","locale":"zh"},"503":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"`preview_message`","locale":"zh"},"504":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"生成纯文本和引用回复草稿，调用本身不发送消息。","locale":"zh"},"505":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#文档模式","content":"资源 `snowluma://onebot/actions` 提供完整目录。详见动作发现与结果。","locale":"zh"},"506":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#连接到-snowluma","content":"在 WebUI 的网络适配器配置中确认 OneBot HTTP 地址与访问令牌。以下配置启用只读执行：","locale":"zh"},"507":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#连接到-snowluma","content":"`127.0.0.1` 指 MCP 进程所在机器。跨机器连接时使用实际服务地址；访问令牌应由客户端配置注入，不要放进提示词。","locale":"zh"},"508":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#连接到-snowluma","content":"执行模式提供 `query_action({ action, params? })`，以及缺少必填参数时请求用户补充的 `query_action_with_input`。完整参数仍可直接交给原工具。","locale":"zh"},"509":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#开启写模式","content":"在上面的 `env` 中增加 `\"SNOWLUMA_MCP_MODE\": \"write\"`，会增加 `invoke_action({ action, params?, execution? })` 和 `invoke_action_with_input`。写模式允许发消息、修改群设置等实际操作，请按所用客户端的授权策略控制调用。","locale":"zh"},"510":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#开启写模式","content":"下面是同时配置可选服务的 `env` 示例。只保留需要的项，目录是 **MCP 主机**上的目录：","locale":"zh"},"511":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"变量","locale":"zh"},"512":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"说明","locale":"zh"},"513":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_ENDPOINT`","locale":"zh"},"514":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"OneBot HTTP 端点；未设置时使用文档模式。","locale":"zh"},"515":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_TOKEN`","locale":"zh"},"516":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"HTTP 和事件连接共用的访问令牌，通过授权请求头发送。","locale":"zh"},"517":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_MODE`","locale":"zh"},"518":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`docs`、`read` 或 `write`。","locale":"zh"},"519":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`","locale":"zh"},"520":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"默认 `30000` 毫秒。普通请求为请求超时；流式请求分别限制连接和每次读取的空闲时间。","locale":"zh"},"521":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_STREAM_DIR`","locale":"zh"},"522":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"下载输出目录；默认系统临时目录下的 `onebot-mcp-downloads`。","locale":"zh"},"523":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_UPLOAD_ROOT`","locale":"zh"},"524":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"允许自动上传的已有目录；未设置时禁止自动读取本地文件上传。","locale":"zh"},"525":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_MAX_STREAM_BYTES`","locale":"zh"},"526":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"单文件上限，正整数，最大且默认为 `4294967296` 字节。","locale":"zh"},"527":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_TASK_DIR`","locale":"zh"},"528":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"后台任务的绝对路径私有目录；要求写模式和有效端点。","locale":"zh"},"529":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_EVENTS_URL`","locale":"zh"},"530":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#环境变量","content":"显式配置的 `ws:` / `wss:` 事件地址；不能带用户名、密码、查询参数或片段。","locale":"zh"},"531":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"用 `search_actions` 找到动作，再用 `get_action` 确认参数、返回结构和标识来源。","locale":"zh"},"532":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"用 `get_runtime_info` 查看配置；需要联网核查时显式传入 `check_connection: true`。","locale":"zh"},"533":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"普通查询用 `query_action`，写入用 `invoke_action`。缺少必填参数时可用对应的 `_with_input` 工具。","locale":"zh"},"534":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"长传输可以创建后台任务；等待后续消息时可以订阅事件。","locale":"zh"},"535":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"检查业务响应和结果诊断，不把“工具调用完成”当成“消息已送达”。","locale":"zh"},"536":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"继续阅读：","locale":"zh"},"537":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"动作发现、结构化结果与追踪","locale":"zh"},"538":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"文件传输与持久化任务","locale":"zh"},"539":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"补充输入与消息预览","locale":"zh"},"540":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-79","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#使用建议","content":"实时事件订阅","locale":"zh"},"541":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp-80","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp#安全边界","content":"动作必须存在于包内目录，并通过读写模式检查。目录查询和默认环境概览不联网；事件连接仅在调用订阅工具后建立。取消或超时不会撤销已到达服务端的操作，也不会触发自动重试。普通业务失败保留 OneBot 响应，需检查 `status`、`retcode` 和结构化诊断；参数、传输及流式协议错误会显式报错。","locale":"zh"},"542":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","type":"page","content":"补充输入与消息预览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","MCP"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","locale":"zh"},"543":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","content":"缺少必填参数时询问用户，并在发送前展示可核对的消息草稿","locale":"zh"},"544":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#请求补充参数","content":"请求补充参数","locale":"zh"},"545":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#客户端兼容性","content":"客户端兼容性","locale":"zh"},"546":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#预览消息草稿","content":"预览消息草稿","locale":"zh"},"547":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#交互面板","content":"交互面板","locale":"zh"},"548":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#请求补充参数","content":"`query_action_with_input` 和 `invoke_action_with_input` 沿用原工具的参数、动作目录和读写权限。只在缺少动作目录顶层 `required` 字段时请求输入，不推测条件必填项，也不替用户填写可选值。原 `query_action`、`invoke_action` 不新增询问步骤。","locale":"zh"},"549":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#请求补充参数","content":"例如向 `invoke_action_with_input` 传入：","locale":"zh"},"550":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#请求补充参数","content":"消息正文缺失时，支持表单的客户端会显示补充请求。当前表单是一个 `params_json` 字符串字段，用户填写的内容为 JSON 对象，例如：","locale":"zh"},"551":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#请求补充参数","content":"已有参数、动作名和执行选项不能通过补充答案覆盖，多余字段和不符合结构的答案会报错。用户拒绝、取消或答案无效时不执行动作。参数齐全时直接执行；自动上传由程序生成的传输字段无需用户补填。","locale":"zh"},"552":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#客户端兼容性","content":"客户端需要声明表单输入能力。新版协议返回 `resultType: \"input_required\"`，由客户端按协议带回请求状态和输入响应；支持输入请求的旧客户端走 `elicitation/create`。不要把继续处理的结果当作最终 OneBot 响应。","locale":"zh"},"553":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#客户端兼容性","content":"不支持表单的客户端会收到明确工具错误，仍可把完整参数交给原工具。继续处理状态绑定原工具和参数，有效期十分钟，只能使用一次；重复或并发提交不会重复执行同一操作。重启会使待补充输入失效，不会重放操作。","locale":"zh"},"554":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#客户端兼容性","content":"补充输入用于收集缺失参数，**不是所有写操作的确认关卡**。已有调用是否需要用户批准，仍由客户端策略决定。","locale":"zh"},"555":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#预览消息草稿","content":"向 `preview_message` 传入：","locale":"zh"},"556":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#预览消息草稿","content":"私聊使用 `private`。目标编号必须是正安全整数；可选引用编号是非零的有符号 32 位整数，负值合法。这里只支持纯文本和引用回复，正文按字面发送，不把类似消息控制码的内容解释为消息段。","locale":"zh"},"557":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#预览消息草稿","content":"所有客户端都会得到文本草稿、`can_send` 和对应 `invoke_action` 参数。调用预览工具本身不发送消息，也不查询被引用的消息。","locale":"zh"},"558":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#交互面板","content":"客户端声明 MCP Apps 扩展 `io.modelcontextprotocol/ui`，并支持 `text/html;profile=mcp-app` 时，工具会提供 `ui://snowluma/message-preview.html` 面板资源。","locale":"zh"},"559":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#交互面板","content":"面板显示目标会话、正文及引用编号。只有用户点击发送按钮后，才通过客户端调用原 `invoke_action`；服务端仍检查写权限。读/文档模式或不支持从面板调用工具的客户端只能预览。","locale":"zh"},"560":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/interaction#交互面板","content":"面板防止重复点击，失败或结果未知时不自动重试。成功提示表示服务端已接受，不能据此保证 QQ 已送达或正确渲染。面板不加载外部脚本、字体或媒体；没有面板支持的客户端继续使用文本结果。","locale":"zh"},"561":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","type":"page","content":"文件传输与后台任务","breadcrumbs":["Docs","MCP"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","locale":"zh"},"562":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","content":"在 MCP 主机与 SnowLuma 之间传输文件，并保存后台任务状态和结果","locale":"zh"},"563":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#选择执行方式","content":"选择执行方式","locale":"zh"},"564":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#上传-mcp-主机的文件","content":"上传 MCP 主机的文件","locale":"zh"},"565":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#下载到-mcp-主机","content":"下载到 MCP 主机","locale":"zh"},"566":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#进度与取消","content":"进度与取消","locale":"zh"},"567":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"启用持久化任务","locale":"zh"},"568":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#重启和存储边界","content":"重启和存储边界","locale":"zh"},"569":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#选择执行方式","content":"普通 `invoke_action` 会等待执行结束再返回；`invoke_action_background` 先保存任务记录并返回编号，稍后通过任务接口查询结果。后台入口目前仅支持目录中标记为流式的动作，不接受普通发消息等动作。","locale":"zh"},"570":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#选择执行方式","content":"两种方式都要求写模式。原有 `query_action` / `invoke_action` 的调用方式不变，后台执行必须显式选择。","locale":"zh"},"571":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#上传-mcp-主机的文件","content":"先把 `SNOWLUMA_MCP_UPLOAD_ROOT` 设置为已有的允许上传目录。向 `invoke_action` 传入：","locale":"zh"},"572":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#上传-mcp-主机的文件","content":"`execution.input_file` 必须解析到上传根目录内；越界路径和指向根目录外的符号链接会被拒绝。传输编号、分块内容等由 MCP 管理，不要再在 `params` 中提供。`execution` 是 MCP 执行选项，不会转发为动作参数。","locale":"zh"},"573":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#上传-mcp-主机的文件","content":"上传完成后返回的 `file_path` 位于 **SnowLuma 服务端**，可供后续发文件或媒体动作使用。上传本身不会向聊天发送消息。这里的 `file_retention` 单位是毫秒，默认五分钟；传 `0` 会禁用服务端完成文件的自动过期。","locale":"zh"},"574":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#上传-mcp-主机的文件","content":"取消或失败会尝试清理未完成上传，但无法撤销已提交的文件；如果完成响应丢失，远端文件仍可能存在。不要据此盲目重试发送。","locale":"zh"},"575":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#下载到-mcp-主机","content":"下面是 `invoke_action` 参数，`params.file` 是 **服务端路径**：","locale":"zh"},"576":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#下载到-mcp-主机","content":"也可按动作说明使用 `file_id`；图片和语音下载分别使用 `download_file_image_stream`、`download_file_record_stream`。文件增量写入 `SNOWLUMA_MCP_STREAM_DIR`，通过完整性检查后才成为完成文件。返回 `file_path`、`file_size`、`sha256`、`frame_count` 和 `terminal`；这个 `file_path` 属于 **MCP 主机**，模型不会收到整个文件的编码内容。","locale":"zh"},"577":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#下载到-mcp-主机","content":"每个客户端最多同时运行四个顶层流式动作。单文件上限由 `SNOWLUMA_MCP_MAX_STREAM_BYTES` 控制，下载目录总配额为其两倍；未知大小的下载会先按单文件上限预留。完成文件不会由 MCP 自动删除，仍占配额，需要自行移走或清理。无效帧、截断、超限、取消等失败会删除本次未完成的下载文件。","locale":"zh"},"578":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#进度与取消","content":"调用时提供标准 `_meta.progressToken`，可收到相同令牌的 `notifications/progress`。下载报告已写入字节，自动上传报告已获服务端确认的字节，普通流报告帧数。只有已知正文件大小时才报告总量。没有进度令牌时不会发送进度通知。","locale":"zh"},"579":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#进度与取消","content":"取消会传递到请求和响应读取。普通请求使用请求超时；流式请求使用连接超时和每次读取的空闲超时。取消不保证远端操作没发生，进度达到末尾也不能代替最终成功结果。后台任务通过任务状态查询结果，不沿用启动请求的进度通知或取消信号；取消它需调用 `tasks/cancel`。","locale":"zh"},"580":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"需要以下条件：","locale":"zh"},"581":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"写模式和 OneBot HTTP 端点。","locale":"zh"},"582":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"`SNOWLUMA_MCP_TASK_DIR` 为绝对路径的私有目录。POSIX 上目录为 `0700`、文件为 `0600`；权限不合要求会报错。","locale":"zh"},"583":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"MCP `2026-07-28` 客户端声明 `extensions: {\"io.modelcontextprotocol/tasks\": {}}`。","locale":"zh"},"584":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"向 `invoke_action_background` 传入与上传示例相同的参数即可。返回结果类似：","locale":"zh"},"585":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"上面的编号只是示例，后续调用须使用真实返回值。","locale":"zh"},"586":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"接口","locale":"zh"},"587":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"用途","locale":"zh"},"588":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"`tasks/get`，参数 `{ \"taskId\": \"...\" }`","locale":"zh"},"589":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"查询状态；结束后读取保存的 `result` 或 `error`。","locale":"zh"},"590":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"`tasks/cancel`，参数 `{ \"taskId\": \"...\" }`","locale":"zh"},"591":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"请求协作式取消，随后再查询最终状态。","locale":"zh"},"592":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"`tasks/update`","locale":"zh"},"593":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"回应尚未解决的任务输入请求；不是任意修改任务的接口。","locale":"zh"},"594":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"工具 `list_tasks`","locale":"zh"},"595":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"按 `cursor`、`limit` 列出任务元数据，不包含结果正文；`limit` 为 1–100，默认 50。","locale":"zh"},"596":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"当前后台传输入口不会自行请求补充输入，也不会与 `_with_input` 自动组合，请先准备完整参数。`tasks/get` 等是协议方法，`list_tasks` 是工具；这里不提供旧版 `tasks/list`、`tasks/result`。","locale":"zh"},"597":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#启用持久化任务","content":"`completed` 表示工具已完成，不保证业务成功；仍需检查嵌套结果的诊断和 OneBot 响应。取消不回滚远端效果，已经完成的操作可能先于取消生效。","locale":"zh"},"598":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#重启和存储边界","content":"结果记录重启后保留，不自动过期或删除。&#x2A;*未完成任务会标记失败，并提示远端结果未知；不会自动重放，也不提供断点续传。** 最多四个并发任务，每条持久化记录上限 16 MiB。","locale":"zh"},"599":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/mcp/transfers#重启和存储边界","content":"同一目录只允许一个运行实例使用，并绑定当前模式、端点和令牌配置的摘要。更换配置时使用新的私有目录，保留旧记录；不要删除历史来掩盖配置错误。文件损坏、权限不足或写入失败会明确报错。任务结果可能含账号数据，应按私有数据保管。","locale":"zh"},"600":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"page","content":"SDK","breadcrumbs":["Docs","SDK"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk","locale":"zh"},"601":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"@snowluma/sdk —— 类型完备的 OneBot 客户端，独立于 SnowLuma 运行时","locale":"zh"},"602":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#安装","content":"安装","locale":"zh"},"603":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"支持的传输","locale":"zh"},"604":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#构造客户端","content":"构造客户端","locale":"zh"},"605":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"HTTP","locale":"zh"},"606":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"WebSocket","locale":"zh"},"607":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"调用一个 action","locale":"zh"},"608":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"订阅事件","locale":"zh"},"609":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"账号上下线","locale":"zh"},"610":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#消息构造器","content":"消息构造器","locale":"zh"},"611":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"自动重连、ack 关联与共享类型","locale":"zh"},"612":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#子路径导入","content":"子路径导入","locale":"zh"},"613":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"相关链接","locale":"zh"},"614":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"`@snowluma/sdk` 是一个 **类型完备的 OneBot v11 客户端**，用 TypeScript 编写。它面向第三方消费者：你不需要在同一个进程里跑 SnowLuma，也不依赖 SnowLuma 运行时——它只是通过 OneBot 的 HTTP / WebSocket 端口连到任意一个正在运行的 SnowLuma 实例。","locale":"zh"},"615":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"包可以直接从 npm 安装。SDK 独立维护动作名、参数和返回值类型，并通过测试与服务端动作注册表及参数解析器核对；发布包不依赖服务端代码。连接的服务端版本仍需与所用能力匹配。","locale":"zh"},"616":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"本章随当前 SDK 源码同步，新增能力是否可用以你安装的 npm 发布包为准；源码更新不代表已发布。请同时核对 SDK 与 SnowLuma 服务端版本。","locale":"zh"},"617":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"想做什么","locale":"zh"},"618":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"从这里开始","locale":"zh"},"619":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"安装、连接、调用动作、订阅事件","locale":"zh"},"620":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"当前页","locale":"zh"},"621":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"发送本机图片或文件、引用回复、等待下一条消息","locale":"zh"},"622":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"消息辅助","locale":"zh"},"623":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"分块上传、逐块下载、处理取消和传输错误","locale":"zh"},"624":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"流式传输","locale":"zh"},"625":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk","content":"SDK 连接的是 SnowLuma 暴露的 OneBot 端口：通常使用 HTTP `http://127.0.0.1:3000/`、WebSocket `ws://127.0.0.1:3001/`，实际地址以服务端配置为准。`accessToken` 同样来自 OneBot 配置。先在 配置 页确认这些网络适配器已启用。","locale":"zh"},"626":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#安装","content":"Node.js 版本要求为 &#x2A;*`^24.22.1 || >=26.12.1`**：24 系列从 24.22.1 起，或 26.12.1 及更新版本；不包含 25 系列。包是纯 ESM（`\"type\": \"module\"`），自带类型声明，可由 Node.js 原生导入，无需打包器。","locale":"zh"},"627":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#安装","content":"保存为 `example.mjs`，安装后运行 `node example.mjs`：","locale":"zh"},"628":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#安装","content":"TypeScript 项目可使用 `module` / `moduleResolution: \"NodeNext\"`，并在自己的 `package.json` 设置 `\"type\": \"module\"`；使用打包器的项目也受支持。","locale":"zh"},"629":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"传输","locale":"zh"},"630":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"客户端类","locale":"zh"},"631":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"默认端点","locale":"zh"},"632":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"HTTP（POST JSON）","locale":"zh"},"633":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"`SnowLumaHttpClient`","locale":"zh"},"634":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"`http://127.0.0.1:3000/`","locale":"zh"},"635":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"WebSocket（主动连接，含事件）","locale":"zh"},"636":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"`SnowLumaWebSocketClient`","locale":"zh"},"637":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"`ws://127.0.0.1:3001/`","locale":"zh"},"638":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#支持的传输","content":"两个客户端都继承自抽象基类 `SnowLumaApiClient`，因此 `call()` / `request()` 以及所有 camelCase action 快捷方法在两种传输上一致。HTTP 适合纯请求-响应的脚本；WebSocket 在此之上还能 **实时接收事件**。`SnowLumaWebSocketClient` 主动连接服务端的正向 WebSocket 地址，不提供接收反向 WebSocket 的监听服务器。","locale":"zh"},"639":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`SnowLumaHttpClientOptions`：","locale":"zh"},"640":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`baseUrl?` —— OneBot HTTP 端点，默认 `http://127.0.0.1:3000/`。","locale":"zh"},"641":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`accessToken?` —— OneBot 配置里的 token；存在时自动加 `Authorization: Bearer <token>`。","locale":"zh"},"642":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`requestTimeoutMs?` —— 默认超时（毫秒），默认 `30000`。","locale":"zh"},"643":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`fetch?` —— 自定义 `fetch` 实现（测试或非标准运行时用）。","locale":"zh"},"644":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#http","content":"`headers?` —— 每次请求附带的额外请求头。","locale":"zh"},"645":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`SnowLumaWebSocketClientOptions`：","locale":"zh"},"646":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`url?` —— OneBot WebSocket 端点，默认 `ws://127.0.0.1:3001/`。","locale":"zh"},"647":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`accessToken?` —— 通过查询参数附加到连接 URL。","locale":"zh"},"648":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`requestTimeoutMs?` —— 默认请求超时，默认 `30000`。","locale":"zh"},"649":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`role?` —— 保留在客户端上的角色属性：`'Api'` | `'Event'` | `'Universal'`（默认 `'Universal'`）；目前不会发送给服务端，不能用它切换端点权限或事件路由。","locale":"zh"},"650":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`reconnect?` —— `true` 或一个 `ReconnectOptions`（`retries` / `minDelayMs` / `maxDelayMs`），开启意外断开后的自动重连。","locale":"zh"},"651":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"`protocols?` / `webSocket?` —— 可选子协议、可选自定义 `WebSocket` 构造器（Node 运行时或测试用）。","locale":"zh"},"652":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"浏览器和 Node 24 都自带全局 `WebSocket`，可直接用。若想用 `ws` 包等实现，把它传给 `webSocket` 选项即可。","locale":"zh"},"653":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#websocket","content":"> 两个工厂函数 `createHttpClient(options?)` 和 `createWebSocketClient(options?)` 与 `new` 等价，按个人偏好选用。","locale":"zh"},"654":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"高频接口提供类型完备的 camelCase 方法（`getLoginInfo`、`sendGroupMessage`、`setGroupBan`……）。任意已注册的 action 都能用 `raw` / `rawResponse` 调用。","locale":"zh"},"655":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"底层方法：","locale":"zh"},"656":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"`call(action, params?, options?)` —— 发送 action，返回 `data`；当 `status` 为 `failed` 或 `retcode !== 0` 时抛 `SnowLumaApiError`。","locale":"zh"},"657":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"`request(action, params?, options?)` —— 返回完整响应信封，不抛业务错。","locale":"zh"},"658":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"已知动作均在 `SnowLumaActionMap` 中提供参数与返回值条目（包含兼容别名）；`ActionParams<动作名>` 与 `ActionResult<动作名>` 可用于你自己的封装。为兼容现有调用，部分结果仍保留宽泛的 JSON 类型；类型检查不替代服务端的范围、权限与状态校验。","locale":"zh"},"659":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#调用一个-action","content":"每次请求都可通过 `RequestOptions` 覆盖行为：`echo`（关联值）、`timeoutMs`（`0` 表示禁用超时）、`signal`（`AbortSignal`）。","locale":"zh"},"660":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"事件订阅是 WebSocket 客户端独有的能力。客户端用 `echo` 关联 API 响应，把没有 `echo` 的包当作事件分发。","locale":"zh"},"661":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#订阅事件","content":"可用的事件助手：`onMessage` / `onPrivateMessage` / `onGroupMessage` / `onNotice(type?)` / `onBotStatus` / `onRequest(type?)` / `onMetaEvent` / `command()`，以及更底层的 `onEvent`、`when(predicate, handler)`、`use(middleware)`。生命周期事件用 `on('open' | 'close' | 'error' | 'response' | 'raw', …)`；每个 `on` / `when` / `use` 都返回一个取消订阅的函数。","locale":"zh"},"662":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"账号上线或下线时会推送一条 notice。`sub_type` 为 `online` 或 `offline`。被踢下线仍是 `bot_offline`。进程退出不会发 `offline`。","locale":"zh"},"663":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"这和 WebUI「设置 → 通知」里的邮件 / Webhook 是两条路：那边给没有机器人的运维用；有机器人时用这条事件自己决定发到哪里。","locale":"zh"},"664":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"也可用 `bot.onNotice('bot_status', handler)` 或 `isBotStatusEvent`。","locale":"zh"},"665":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"事件上下文（`ctx`）内置快捷操作：","locale":"zh"},"666":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"`ctx.reply(message)` —— 按私聊 / 群聊发送普通回复。","locale":"zh"},"667":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"`ctx.quote(message)` —— 在 SDK 创建的消息事件上下文中，引用当前消息回复；见消息辅助。","locale":"zh"},"668":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"`ctx.approve()` / `ctx.reject(reason)` —— 处理好友或群请求。","locale":"zh"},"669":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"`ctx.quickOperation(operation)` —— 调用 `.handle_quick_operation`。","locale":"zh"},"670":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#账号上下线","content":"`ctx.stopPropagation()` —— 停止后续中间件分发。","locale":"zh"},"671":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#消息构造器","content":"SDK 自带链式消息构造器和段工厂，发送接口直接接受它的产物：","locale":"zh"},"672":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#消息构造器","content":"内置段：`text`、`br`、`face`、`at`、`atAll`、`reply`、`image`、`record`、`video`、`json`、`xml`、`poke`、`forward`、`node`、`share`、`music`、`location`、`contact`、`raw`。`reply()` 在一条链里只能出现一次。","locale":"zh"},"673":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#消息构造器","content":"消息段里的字符串文件路径（如上例 `/tmp/a.png`）指向 **SnowLuma 服务端**，不会自动读取 SDK 所在机器的文件；本机媒体请使用本地媒体发送方法。消息 ID 是非零有符号 32 位整数，负值有效；引用、查询和撤回时应原样保留，不能取绝对值。","locale":"zh"},"674":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"**ack 关联** —— WebSocket 客户端给每个请求生成 `echo`，把响应路由回对应的 `Promise`，因此并发请求不会串台。可通过 `RequestOptions.echo` 覆盖关联值。","locale":"zh"},"675":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"**自动重连** —— `reconnect: true`（或 `ReconnectOptions`）启用指数退避（`minDelayMs` 默认 1000，`maxDelayMs` 默认 30000）。断线时所有挂起请求会以 `SnowLumaConnectionError` 拒绝。","locale":"zh"},"676":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"**类型兼容** —— SDK 导出的动作类型可供消费端共享，但与服务端代码独立维护。包内目录代表该 SDK 版本已知的动作，不是对远端能力的探测；自定义或动态动作仍可通过 `raw()` / `rawResponse()` 调用。","locale":"zh"},"677":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#自动重连ack-关联与共享类型","content":"**业务与传输错误** —— SDK 的业务和传输错误类继承 `SnowLumaError`：业务失败抛 `SnowLumaApiError`（鉴权类 retcode 走 `SnowLumaAuthError`），传输层抛 `SnowLumaTransportError` 基类下的 `SnowLumaConnectionError` / `SnowLumaParseError` / `SnowLumaTimeoutError` / `SnowLumaAbortError`。本地参数校验、文件访问和部分上下文操作也可能抛出原生异常，不能只捕获 `SnowLumaError`。","locale":"zh"},"678":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#子路径导入","content":"除了主入口，包还提供分模块导出：`@snowluma/sdk/client`、`/messages`、`/events`、`/types`、`/errors`、`/actions`、`/node`。按需精确导入即可。","locale":"zh"},"679":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#子路径导入","content":"`SNOWLUMA_ACTIONS`、`isSnowLumaAction` 和类型 `SnowLumaKnownAction` 可从主入口或 `/actions` 导入。`/node` 单独提供读取本机文件的 `localFile()`，主入口及浏览器入口不会引入 Node 文件系统模块。","locale":"zh"},"680":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-79","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"消息辅助 —— 本地媒体一站式发送、引用回复与事件等待。","locale":"zh"},"681":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-80","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"流式传输 —— 上传、下载、进度与取消。","locale":"zh"},"682":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-81","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"配置 —— 启用并保护 OneBot HTTP / WS 网络适配器，拿到 `accessToken`。","locale":"zh"},"683":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-82","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"开发者文档 —— monorepo 结构与运行时内部。","locale":"zh"},"684":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk-83","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk#相关链接","content":"MCP 服务 —— 给 LLM 用的另一套接入方式。","locale":"zh"},"685":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","type":"page","content":"消息辅助","breadcrumbs":["Docs","SDK"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","locale":"zh"},"686":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","content":"本地媒体一站式发送、显式引用回复与未来事件等待","locale":"zh"},"687":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"本地媒体一站式发送","locale":"zh"},"688":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#从-nodejs-发送文件","content":"从 Node.js 发送文件","locale":"zh"},"689":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"字节、浏览器文件与流","locale":"zh"},"690":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#错误与取消","content":"错误与取消","locale":"zh"},"691":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","type":"he