"zh"},"702":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`sendPrivateImage`","locale":"zh"},"703":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`{ message_id }`","locale":"zh"},"704":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"语音","locale":"zh"},"705":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`sendGroupRecord`","locale":"zh"},"706":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`sendPrivateRecord`","locale":"zh"},"707":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`{ message_id }`","locale":"zh"},"708":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"视频","locale":"zh"},"709":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`sendGroupVideo`","locale":"zh"},"710":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`sendPrivateVideo`","locale":"zh"},"711":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`{ message_id }`","locale":"zh"},"712":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"文件","locale":"zh"},"713":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`sendGroupFile`","locale":"zh"},"714":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`sendPrivateFile`","locale":"zh"},"715":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#本地媒体一站式发送","content":"`{ file_id }`","locale":"zh"},"716":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#从-nodejs-发送文件","content":"`localFile(pathOrFileURL)` **只能从 `@snowluma/sdk/node` 导入**，返回带文件名、由文件支撑的 `Blob` 来源，不会一次把整个文件读入内存。路径位于 SDK 所在机器；发送结束前不要修改文件。文件不存在、不是普通文件或读取期间被修改时会报错。主入口与浏览器入口不引入 Node 文件系统模块。","locale":"zh"},"717":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"媒体来源支持：","locale":"zh"},"718":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"`Uint8Array`（包括 Node.js `Buffer`）。","locale":"zh"},"719":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"`Blob` 或浏览器选择得到的 `File`；`File` 会自动提供文件名。","locale":"zh"},"720":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"`ReadableStream<Uint8Array>` 或 `AsyncIterable<Uint8Array>`（包括字节模式的 Node.js 可读流）；必须提供 `fileSize`。","locale":"zh"},"721":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"`{ source, filename }`：在不改变字节来源的情况下指定文件名。","locale":"zh"},"722":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"显式 `filename` 选项优先于来源携带的文件名。文件发送的 `name` 是 QQ 中显示的名称，默认使用上传文件名；群文件还可传 `folder` / `folderId`。","locale":"zh"},"723":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"媒体属性分别放在 `image`、`record`、`video` 下。`video.thumb` 仍是**服务端路径**，不会自动上传缩略图。这些新方法不接受字符串本地路径，必须显式使用 `localFile()` 或提供字节来源。","locale":"zh"},"724":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#字节浏览器文件与流","content":"可用的上传选项详见流式传输，包括 `chunkSize`、`expectedSha256`、`fileRetention`、`signal`、`onProgress`。进度统计的是服务端确认收到的字节数，不代表 QQ 消息已送达。","locale":"zh"},"725":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#错误与取消","content":"`SnowLumaMediaSendError` 的 `stage` 为 `upload` 或 `send`，`cause` 保留原始业务、取消或超时错误；上传已完成时还包含 `upload` 元数据。`localFile()` 自身的打开错误直接抛出，不会包装成发送错误。","locale":"zh"},"726":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#错误与取消","content":"`timeoutMs` 分别作用于每次上传请求和最终发送请求，并非整个流程或来源读取的总时限。需要整体取消时使用自己的 `AbortSignal`。两阶段之间取消会阻止发送；发送请求已经发出后再取消或超时，不能据此判断消息未发送。SDK 不自动重试、回滚或删除服务端文件。群文件聊天发布失败会报错，并保留已上传文件 ID 的错误上下文。","locale":"zh"},"727":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#显式引用回复","content":"在 SDK 创建的消息事件上下文中，使用 `ctx.quote()` 引用当前消息；普通 `ctx.reply()` 的行为不变。","locale":"zh"},"728":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#显式引用回复","content":"`ctx.quote()` 自动选择当前私聊或群聊，并使用事件的消息 ID；非消息事件调用会被拒绝。事件外（包括 HTTP 客户端）使用 `quoteMessage()` 构造相同内容：","locale":"zh"},"729":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#显式引用回复","content":"`quoteMessage(messageId, body, options?)` 也从 `@snowluma/sdk/messages` 导出。它只构造内容，不查询历史或发起请求；服务端必须能解析被引用的消息 ID。ID 必须是**非零有符号 32 位整数**，负值原样保留。","locale":"zh"},"730":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#显式引用回复","content":"正文接受普通字符串、CQ 字符串、单个消息段、消息段数组或消息链。默认保留字符串原有的 CQ 字段和转义；`autoEscape: true` 会把字符串作为引用后的纯文本，数组和消息链仍保持结构化。正文已有回复段时拒绝再次添加；不会修改传入内容。","locale":"zh"},"731":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#显式引用回复","content":"旧 `SnowLumaEventContext` 对象和显式标注的旧处理器类型仍可使用。SDK 创建的上下文及客户端推导出的回调参数提供 `SnowLumaEventContextWithQuote`。需要标注可复用的新处理器时，使用 `EventHandler<MyEvent, SnowLumaEventContextWithQuote<MyEvent>>`；中间件和命令处理器也提供对应的上下文类型参数。","locale":"zh"},"732":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"WebSocket 客户端提供 `waitForEvent(predicate?, options?)` 和 `waitForMessage(predicate?, options?)`，也支持只传选项对象。筛选函数必须同步返回布尔值；类型守卫还能收窄结果类型。","locale":"zh"},"733":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"下面先注册等待，再发送消息，避免快速回复早于监听器到达：","locale":"zh"},"734":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"等待会同步注册监听器，但不会自动连接、回放历史、消耗其他监听器的事件，也不会跨重连保留。它监听与 `onEvent` 相同的公开事件流，位于**中间件之后**；被中间件停止传播的事件不可见。多个等待可以由同一个事件完成。","locale":"zh"},"735":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"`waitForMessage` 同时包含 `message` 和 `message_sent`。只等对方回复时，要像上例一样筛选方向、会话和发送者。","locale":"zh"},"736":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"结果","locale":"zh"},"737":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"行为","locale":"zh"},"738":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"满足筛选条件","locale":"zh"},"739":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"返回事件，移除监听器、取消处理器和定时器","locale":"zh"},"740":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"超时","locale":"zh"},"741":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"抛 `SnowLumaTimeoutError`","locale":"zh"},"742":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"`signal` 取消","locale":"zh"},"743":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"抛 `SnowLumaAbortError`","locale":"zh"},"744":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"断线或显式 `close()`","locale":"zh"},"745":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"抛 `SnowLumaConnectionError`，重连不会恢复该等待","locale":"zh"},"746":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"筛选函数抛错","locale":"zh"},"747":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"原样拒绝等待","locale":"zh"},"748":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/messaging#等待未来事件","content":"所有结束路径都会清理监听器与定时器。默认超时继承客户端 `requestTimeoutMs`（默认 30 秒），`0` 禁用超时。取消等待本身不会关闭客户端或撤销已发出的消息；上例的 `finally` 由脚本自行关闭连接。","locale":"zh"},"749":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","type":"page","content":"流式传输","breadcrumbs":["Docs","SDK"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","locale":"zh"},"750":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","content":"增量上传、逐块下载，以及流式响应的取消、校验和错误处理","locale":"zh"},"751":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"上传文件","locale":"zh"},"752":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#下载文件","content":"下载文件","locale":"zh"},"753":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#逐帧读取","content":"逐帧读取","locale":"zh"},"754":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"取消、超时和缓冲区","locale":"zh"},"755":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","content":"HTTP 与 WebSocket 客户端都支持流式上传、下载。原有 `request()`、`call()`、`raw()`、`rawResponse()` 和 `downloadFile()` 继续保持单响应语义；多帧响应请使用本页的方法。只想上传后直接发送图片或文件时，见消息辅助。","locale":"zh"},"756":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","content":"本页随当前 SDK 源码同步，是否可用以安装的 npm 发布包为准。连接的 SnowLuma 服务端也必须支持相应的流式动作；客户端安装与配置见 SDK 首页。","locale":"zh"},"757":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`uploadFileStream(source, options?)` 逐块上传，等待每块确认后再继续，最后独立发起完成请求。返回 `UploadFileStreamComplete`，包含 `file_path`、`file_size`、`sha256` 等完成信息。","locale":"zh"},"758":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`source` 接受 `Uint8Array`（含 Node.js `Buffer`）、`Blob`、`ReadableStream<Uint8Array>` 或 `AsyncIterable<Uint8Array>`。字节数组和 `Blob` 可推导大小；流或异步迭代器必须提供 `fileSize`，以便上传前确定总分块数。实际长度与声明大小不一致会报错，空文件也受支持。","locale":"zh"},"759":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"选项","locale":"zh"},"760":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"含义","locale":"zh"},"761":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`fileSize`","locale":"zh"},"762":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"总字节数；流来源必填","locale":"zh"},"763":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`filename`","locale":"zh"},"764":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"上传文件名","locale":"zh"},"765":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`chunkSize`","locale":"zh"},"766":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"每块解码后字节数，默认 64 KiB，范围 1–1048576","locale":"zh"},"767":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`expectedSha256`","locale":"zh"},"768":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"预期摘要；由服务端验证，SDK 也核对完成信息中的摘要","locale":"zh"},"769":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`fileRetention`","locale":"zh"},"770":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"完成文件在服务端的保留毫秒数，`0` 禁用过期；当前服务端默认五分钟","locale":"zh"},"771":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`streamId`","locale":"zh"},"772":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"新上传的唯一标识；省略时自动生成，不能复用已有上传","locale":"zh"},"773":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`onProgress`","locale":"zh"},"774":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"每块确认后调用，可返回 Promise；SDK 等其完成才继续读取","locale":"zh"},"775":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`signal` / `timeoutMs` / `echo`","locale":"zh"},"776":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"请求取消、超时和关联值；边界见下文","locale":"zh"},"777":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`file_path` 位于 **SnowLuma 服务端**。完成上传不会写入 SDK 机器的文件，也不会自动发送 QQ 消息。该方法不提供断点续传或自动重试。","locale":"zh"},"778":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"`signal` 会取消请求并关闭可读来源。自定义异步迭代器应接收同一信号，让挂起读取和清理能结束；SDK 无法强制任意生产者完成自己的 Promise。示例为 Node.js 来源传入了同一信号。","locale":"zh"},"779":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#上传文件","content":"失败或取消的上传不会被完成；部分上传由服务端空闲超时清理（当前为十分钟）。SDK 不自动发重置请求，也不删除已完成的服务端文件。保留时间与部分上传清理属于服务端策略，以实际部署版本为准。","locale":"zh"},"780":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#下载文件","content":"`downloadFileStream(params, options?)` 返回异步迭代器，每次提供一个 `Uint8Array` 字节块。以下 Node.js 示例下载到独立临时文件，校验完成后再移动到目标路径：","locale":"zh"},"781":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#下载文件","content":"参数选择服务端 `file` 或 `file_id`，并可提供 `chunk_size`。`options.action` 可以选 `download_file_stream`（默认）、`download_file_image_stream`、`download_file_record_stream`。`onInfo` 在第一个字节块输出前运行。","locale":"zh"},"782":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#下载文件","content":"迭代器最终返回 `DownloadFileStreamComplete`。`for await` 与 `pipeline()` 会读完并校验传输，但丢弃迭代器的最终返回值；需要其中的 `total_bytes` / `total_chunks` 时，手动调用 `iterator.next()` 并读取 `done: true` 时的 `value`。","locale":"zh"},"783":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#下载文件","content":"SDK 解码并检查分块顺序、块长度和最终总数。初始文件大小为零可能表示大小未知，最终字节数和块数仍必须匹配。缺少元数据、格式错误、传输截断和服务端失败都会抛错，已被应用消费的字节不会回滚。","locale":"zh"},"784":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#逐帧读取","content":"需要原始分块信息时，使用 `stream()` 或 `requestStream()`：","locale":"zh"},"785":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#逐帧读取","content":"`requestStream()` 返回完整响应信封，包括最终失败信封；调用方自行判断业务是否成功。","locale":"zh"},"786":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#逐帧读取","content":"`stream()` 返回类型化数据载荷，遇到失败信封时抛 `SnowLumaApiError` 或其鉴权子类，即使之前已收到数据也会报错。","locale":"zh"},"787":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#逐帧读取","content":"两者支持三个下载动作、`test_download_stream`、`upload_file_stream`。每次上传请求只返回一次确认，包括 `type: 'stream'` 的分块确认；底层调用者需要另外发完成请求。重置仍保留服务端现有的失败信封语义。","locale":"zh"},"788":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"`signal`、`echo` 和 `timeoutMs` 与普通请求一样可用。超时覆盖一次活跃流式请求（包含 WebSocket 建连）；上传则分别对每块及完成请求计时。`0` 禁用超时；来源读取和应用回调不受请求超时计时。整体流程请使用自己的取消信号。","locale":"zh"},"789":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"停止迭代会释放客户端资源。HTTP 还会取消响应体；WebSocket 只停止收集当前请求，不关闭共享连接。协议没有逐请求取消下载的消息，服务端可能继续发剩余帧。因此请为传输使用唯一 `echo`，不要在旧帧可能到达时复用已取消传输的关联值。断线使活跃传输失败，重连不重放它们。","locale":"zh"},"790":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"选项","locale":"zh"},"791":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"默认值","locale":"zh"},"792":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"作用","locale":"zh"},"793":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"`maxBufferBytes`","locale":"zh"},"794":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"32 MiB","locale":"zh"},"795":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"限制单个 HTTP 帧或排队的 WebSocket 载荷字节数","locale":"zh"},"796":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"`maxBufferedFrames`","locale":"zh"},"797":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"256","locale":"zh"},"798":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"限制排队的 WebSocket 帧数","locale":"zh"},"799":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"超限会抛错，不会静默丢帧或把整个文件无限缓存。HTTP 按消费速度读取，WebSocket 没有逐请求背压；向较慢的目标下载大文件时，优先使用 HTTP。","locale":"zh"},"800":{"id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/sdk/streaming#取消超时和缓冲区","content":"流式类型从 `@snowluma/sdk` 与 `@snowluma/sdk/types` 导出。自定义 `SnowLumaApiClient` 子类实现 `requestStream()` 后即可支持流式调用；只实现 `request()` 的旧子类仍兼容，尝试流式调用时会明确报不支持。","locale":"zh"},"801":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","type":"page","content":"宝塔面板部署","breadcrumbs":["Docs","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","locale":"zh"},"802":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","content":"在已安装宝塔面板的 Linux 服务器上通过 Docker 应用商店一键部署 SnowLuma","locale":"zh"},"803":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"导入并安装","locale":"zh"},"804":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#首次登录","content":"首次登录","locale":"zh"},"805":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#相关链接","content":"相关链接","locale":"zh"},"806":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","content":"此方案由社区贡献与维护。遇到问题欢迎 提交 Issue 反馈。","locale":"zh"},"807":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","content":"本页讲的是\"你已经有宝塔面板，想通过面板的 Docker 应用商店一键导入 SnowLuma\"。底层仍然是 Docker 部署 的同一镜像，只是省去了手写 Compose 文件的步骤。","locale":"zh"},"808":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"在宝塔面板中进入 **Docker → 应用商店**","locale":"zh"},"809":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"切换到 **外部应用** 分类，点击右上角 **导入应用**","locale":"zh"},"810":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"填入仓库地址：`https://github.com/makotowu/SnowLuma.Docker.Baota`","locale":"zh"},"811":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"找到 **SnowLuma**，点击安装","locale":"zh"},"812":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"按提示填写配置：","locale":"zh"},"813":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"**VNC 密码**：面板若要求填写，请设成你自己的强密码，不要用旧文档或网上示例里的固定值。官方镜像本身没有公开的默认密码。","locale":"zh"},"814":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"**WebUI 端口**：默认 `5099`","locale":"zh"},"815":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"**noVNC 端口**：默认 `6081`，浏览器远程桌面","locale":"zh"},"816":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"**OneBot WS 端口**：默认 `3001`，机器人框架对接","locale":"zh"},"817":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#导入并安装","content":"安装完成后，容器即在宝塔的 Docker 管理中可见，日志、启停、编辑均可通过面板操作。","locale":"zh"},"818":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#首次登录","content":"启动后和使用标准 Docker 部署**完全一样**：","locale":"zh"},"819":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#首次登录","content":"浏览器打开 `http://<服务器IP>:6081/`（noVNC），输入你设置的 VNC 密码","locale":"zh"},"820":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#首次登录","content":"在远程桌面里用手机 QQ 扫码登录","locale":"zh"},"821":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#首次登录","content":"登录完成后 hook 自动切到工作模式","locale":"zh"},"822":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/baota#首次登录","content":"浏览器打开 `http://<服务器IP>:5099/