t","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#数据卷","content":"`qq-client-data`","locale":"zh"},"949":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-121","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#数据卷","content":"`/app/.local/share`","locale":"zh"},"950":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-122","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#数据卷","content":"QQ 用户数据（登录态、缓存等）。","locale":"zh"},"951":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-123","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#数据卷","content":"**升级镜像不要删这三个卷**，否则会丢登录态和配置。","locale":"zh"},"952":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-124","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#首次登录","content":"启动容器后用浏览器打开 `http://<IP>:6081/`（noVNC），输入日志里的远程桌面密码（见「远程桌面密码」）。","locale":"zh"},"953":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-125","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#首次登录","content":"在远程桌面里能看到 QQ 已自动起来，扫码登录。","locale":"zh"},"954":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-126","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#首次登录","content":"登录完成后 hook 会自动从被动观察切到工作模式，无需在 WebUI 里手动 Load。","locale":"zh"},"955":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-127","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#首次登录","content":"浏览器打开 `http://<IP>:5099/` 访问 SnowLuma WebUI。","locale":"zh"},"956":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-128","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#找-webui-临时密码","content":"首次启动会在日志里输出一次性密码：","locale":"zh"},"957":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-129","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#找-webui-临时密码","content":"只要密码字符串：","locale":"zh"},"958":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-130","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#找-webui-临时密码","content":"临时密码**只在全新数据卷首次启动时**输出一次。复用旧卷 / 重启都不会重新生成。","locale":"zh"},"959":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-131","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#多开-qq多账号","content":"Linux QQ 自带单实例锁：在已有 QQ 跑着的桌面里直接再点一次 QQ 图标，只会把已有窗口聚焦，**起不来第二个进程**。锁文件落在 `$HOME/.config/QQ/SingletonLock`，所以解法是给第二个实例一个&#x2A;*独立的 `HOME`**。","locale":"zh"},"960":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-132","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#多开-qq多账号","content":"SnowLuma 一侧不需要任何额外配置：HookManager 会遍历所有 QQ 主进程，新启动一个就自动注入一个，每个 UIN 拉一个独立 `OneBotInstance`，配置存到对应的 `config/onebot_<uin>.json`。","locale":"zh"},"961":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-133","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#推荐用环境变量自动启动","content":"给每个额外账号准备一个独立卷，并把对应容器路径写进 `SNOWLUMA_EXTRA_QQ_HOMES`。列表支持逗号或空格分隔：","locale":"zh"},"962":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-134","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#推荐用环境变量自动启动","content":"容器启动时会为每个额外 `HOME` 生成一个 supervisor program，使用 `snowluma` 用户、同一个 `DISPLAY=:1` 和同一组 `SNOWLUMA_QQ_FLAGS` 启动 QQ。这样不会出现手动 `docker exec` 默认 root 导致 SnowLuma 无法注入的问题。","locale":"zh"},"963":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-135","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#推荐用环境变量自动启动","content":"查看进程状态：","locale":"zh"},"964":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-136","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#临时手动启动一个账号","content":"如果只是临时多开，不想改 Compose，也可以手动启动。关键是**不要用 root**，要显式指定 `snowluma` 用户、`DISPLAY` 和独立 `HOME`：","locale":"zh"},"965":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-137","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#临时手动启动一个账号","content":"如果 `/app/qq-acct2` 没有挂卷，容器重建后这个账号的登录态会丢；长期使用仍推荐上面的 Compose 方式。","locale":"zh"},"966":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-138","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#限制--注意","content":"**每个 QQ 实例独占自己的 `HOME`** —— 别让两个 QQ 共用同一个 `HOME`，会冲突。","locale":"zh"},"967":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-139","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#限制--注意","content":"**资源**：每个 QQ 进程跑 Chromium 大概吃 300-500MB 内存，`--shm-size` 主账号 1GB 够用，多开建议加到 `2gb` 或更高。","locale":"zh"},"968":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-140","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#限制--注意","content":"**noVNC 同屏可见**：多个 QQ 窗口都在同一个 Xvfb 桌面里，VNC 进去可以分别操作。如果只想登一次就走，登完后把 QQ 窗口最小化即可，不会影响 hook。","locale":"zh"},"969":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-141","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#限制--注意","content":"**WebUI 自动列出所有 UIN**：SnowLuma 不需要单独配置就能识别新登录的账号，WebUI / `get_login_info` 都会出现新 UIN。","locale":"zh"},"970":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-142","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#限制--注意","content":"**不要用桌面 autostart 目录**：镜像使用 `fluxbox`，不是 XFCE/GNOME 会话；`~/.config/autostart/*.desktop` 不一定会被读取。多开自启交给 supervisor 更稳。","locale":"zh"},"971":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-143","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#自动注入","content":"镜像默认开 `SNOWLUMA_HOOK_AUTOLOAD=1`：容器一启动就把 hook 注入 QQ 主进程（被动观察），扫码登录完成后 hook 自动切到工作模式。supervisor 让 QQ 崩溃自动重启时也走同样流程。","locale":"zh"},"972":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-144","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#关闭自动注入","content":"想保留传统