anager`** — owns `OneBotInstance`s keyed by UIN; each instance has its own `MessageStore`, `MediaStore`, and `NetworkManager`."],[230,"**`OneBotManager`** —— 按 UIN 创建 `OneBotInstance`；持有 `MessageStore` / `MediaStore` / `NetworkManager`。"],[2001,"**`Server`** — alias for `WebSocketServer`."],[251,"**`Server`** —— `WebSocketServer` 别名。"],[1988,"**`unloadModuleManual`** — unload an injected module."],[238,"**`unloadModuleManual`** —— 卸载已注入模块。"],[1999,"**`WebSocket`** — client constructor."],[249,"**`WebSocket`** —— 客户端构造器。"],[2000,"**`WebSocketServer`** — server constructor."],[250,"**`WebSocketServer`** —— 服务端构造器。"],[2141,"**1. Start the container**"],[391,"**1. 拉起容器**"],[2143,"**2. Scan the login QR**"],[393,"**2. 扫码登录**"],[2146,"**3. Open the WebUI**"],[396,"**3. 打开 WebUI**"],[2912,"**A no-root Linux userland on Android is easy** — install Termux + a Ubuntu via `proot-distro`."],[1386,"**A、B 二选一，不要两个都装。** Docker Desktop 集成和发行版内的原生 dockerd 同时存在会互相打架。"],[2424,"**Ack correlation** — the WebSocket client generates an `echo` per request and routes the response back to the right `Promise`, so concurrent requests never cross. Override the correlation value via `RequestOptions.echo`."],[674,"**ack 关联** —— WebSocket 客户端给每个请求生成 `echo`，把响应路由回对应的 `Promise`，因此并发请求不会串台。可通过 `RequestOptions.echo` 覆盖关联值。"],[2718,"**All windows share the same Xvfb desktop**: noVNC shows every QQ window; minimize the ones you've already logged into. Hook keeps working regardless of window state."],[2018,"**API docs automation** — just add the action with `defineAction` (optionally `returnsSchema` to describe `data`); `catalog.json` is kept in sync by the `sync-docs-catalog` workflow, so the API reference never drifts. Run `pnpm api:generate` locally to preview."],[268,"**API 文档自动化**：用 `defineAction` 新增动作（可选 `returnsSchema` 描述 `data`）即可——`catalog.json` 由 `sync-docs-catalog` workflow 自动同步，API 参考不会过时；本地预览可手动 `pnpm api:generate`。"],[2934,"**arm64.** Phones are almost always arm64 — pick the `arm64` builds of Node, Linux QQ, and SnowLuma."],[1184,"**arm64。** 手机基本都是 arm64，记得 Node、Linux QQ、SnowLuma 都要选 `arm64` 版本。"],[1808,"**Auto-generated**: missing per-account config or access tokens are written automatically in normalized form on first run."],[2425,"**Auto-reconnect** — `reconnect: true` (or a `ReconnectOptions`) enables exponential backoff (`minDelayMs` defaults to 1000, `maxDelayMs` to 30000). On disconnect, all pending requests reject with `SnowLumaConnectionError`."],[2053,"**Built-in WebUI** — manage accounts, config, and status from the browser."],[2427,"**Business and transport errors** — SDK business and transport error classes extend `SnowLumaError`: business failures throw `SnowLumaApiError` (auth-class retcodes become `SnowLumaAuthError`); transport issues throw the `SnowLumaTransportError` subclasses `SnowLumaConnectionError` / `SnowLumaParseError` / `SnowLumaTimeoutError` / `SnowLumaAbortError`. Local validation, file access, and some context operations can also throw native exceptions, so handling only `SnowLumaError` is insufficient."],[2913,"**But real Docker (dockerd) does not work under proot.** proot is just a ptrace-based syscall emulator; it has no namespaces / cgroups / netfilter, which is exactly what a container runtime depends on."],[2158,"**Consumed once**: the password is **stripped from the address bar immediately** after load (`history.replaceState`) so it can't leak via browser history / access logs / the Referer header."],[2993,"**Do not delete the data volumes** (`qq-gateway-data`, `qq-client-config`, `qq-client-data`). Deleting them loses your login and config. `docker rm` only removes the container, not the volumes — recreate with the same volume names and it picks up right where it left off."],[2917,"**Do not install Termux from Google Play.** The Play Store build is long-abandoned and has known issues. Install from **F-Droid** or Termux's GitHub Releases."],[2720,"**Do not rely on desktop autostart folders**: the image uses `fluxbox`, not an XFCE/GNOME session. `~/.config/autostart/*.desktop` may not be read. Let supervisor handle multi-account boot instead."],[2789,"**Docker on Linux is the recommended, easiest method** — the image bundles QQ + Xvfb + VNC + noVNC + supervisord, so the host only needs Docker."],[2119,"**Docker** (easiest, recommended)"],[2060,"**Docker** (recommended)"],[369,"**Docker**（最推荐、最省事）"],[310,"**Docker**（推荐）"],[2014,"**Don't bypass `BridgeManager`** — every OneBot action should reach NTQQ through `BridgeInterface`. Keeps the OneBot layer decoupled and testable."],[2701,"**Don't delete these on upgrade** — you'll lose login state and configuration."],[2866,"**Dropped on node upgrade / copy** — re-run `setcap` after every Node upgrade."],[2152,"**Find the WebUI temp password**: on the **first** start with a fresh data dir, a one-time admin password is printed to the logs. Docker:"],[3062,"**Full** — bundles a Node.js runtime, no separate Node install, larger."],[1806,"**Global**: `config/onebot.json` — the default for every account."],[2015,"**Keep configs auto-generatable** — new fields must stay backwards-compatible; normalize them on load and write the result back."],[2624,"**Leave `VNC_PASSWD` unset**: the first start generates a random password and **prints it once** in the container logs (one Chinese line, one English line). It is kept on the data volume. Recreating the container or upgrading the image does not change it, as long as the volume is still there, and it will not be printed again."],[2790,"**Linux manual** and **mobile** are advanced / unofficial paths: more steps, more pitfalls, and injection may not work in restricted environments (e.g. proot). Unless you know what you're doing, prefer Docker."],[1039,"**Linux 上 Docker 是最推荐、最省事的方式** —— 镜像把 QQ + Xvfb + VNC + noVNC + supervisord 全打包好了，宿主机只需要 Docker。"],[1040,"**Linux 手动**和**手机**部署属于进阶 / 非官方路径：步骤多、坑多、注入在受限环境（如 proot）下可能不可用。除非你清楚自己在做什么，否则优先走 Docker。"],[3064,"**Lite** — no Node.js, you install Node yourself first, much smaller."],[2055,"**MCP server** — `@snowluma/mcp`, so MCP-capable AI clients can query and invoke OneBot actions."],[305,"**MCP 服务** —— `@snowluma/mcp`，让支持 MCP 的 AI 客户端查询并调用 OneBot action。"],[313,"**MCP**"],[2063,"**MCP**"],[1810,"**Migrating from the old format**: earlier versions kept `httpServers` / `wsServers` arrays at the top level and used `httpPostEndpoints` for reporting. SnowLuma detects this layout, moves the entries into the `networks` object, renames `httpPostEndpoints` to `httpClients`, and writes the result back to disk. If you maintain configs by hand, use the new shape."],[2052,"**Multi-account** — one OneBot instance per UIN, auto-detected and auto-attached, no manual config."],[2865,"**Must be applied to the real binary** — `readlink -f` resolves the symlink behind `which node`; the capability does not follow symlinks."],[2016,"**Native modules are per-platform** — when adding a platform, sync the `.node` and the injectable library."],[2867,"**Needs an xattr-capable filesystem** — `setcap` fails on some overlay / tmpfs mounts."],[3108,"**Never expose the WebUI / OneBot ports raw on the public internet.** These ports give full control over your QQ. For remote access, go through a reverse proxy with auth or an authenticated tunnel, and change the default credentials."],[2861,"**Never expose VNC (5900) / noVNC (6081) / WebUI (5099) / OneBot (3000, 3001) raw on the public internet.** Bind them to localhost behind a firewall, an SSH tunnel, or an authenticated reverse proxy. Always set a strong VNC password — otherwise your QQ desktop is wide open."],[1116,"**node 升级 / 拷贝后会丢**，每次升级 Node 都要重新 `setcap`。"],[2148,"**Not the default.** This script is in Alpha and will change. If you already have Docker, use the section above. If you want to help test it:"],[2565,"**noVNC Port**: default `6081`, browser-based remote desktop"],[968,"**noVNC 同屏可见**：多个 QQ 窗口都在同一个 Xvfb 桌面里，VNC 进去可以分别操作。如果只想登一次就走，登完后把 QQ 窗口最小化即可，不会影响 hook。"],[815,"**noVNC 端口**：默认 `6081`，浏览器远程桌面"],[2051,"**NTQQ bridge** — talks to the real QQ client directly; no protocol account, no separate login."],[301,"**NTQQ 桥接** —— 直接对接真实 QQ 客户端，无需协议号、无需独立登录。"],[2716,"**One HOME per QQ instance** — never share a `HOME` between two QQs; they'll fight over the lock file."],[2050,"**OneBot v11 adapters** — HTTP API server, WebSocket server, reverse WebSocket, and HTTP event reporting, in any combination."],[300,"**OneBot v11 适配器** —— HTTP API 服务、WebSocket 服务、反向 WebSocket、HTTP 事件上报，任意组合。"],[2566,"**OneBot WS Port**: default `3001`, for bot framework integration"],[816,"**OneBot WS 端口**：默认 `3001`，机器人框架对接"],[2154,"**Open ports**: to reach it from outside, allow the WebUI (`5099`) and whichever OneBot ports you use (`3000` / `3001`)."],[2882,"**Package names / paths** vary by distro (above assumes Ubuntu 24.04). Debian, Arch, and RHEL-family systems differ on `libasound`, the X tools, and the noVNC launcher path."],[1807,"**Per-account**: `config/onebot_<uin>.json` — overrides the global file."],[3136,"**Pick Route A or B — don't run both.** Docker Desktop's integration and a native dockerd inside the distro will fight each other if both are present."],[2066,"**Prebuilt tarball**"],[2932,"**ptrace injection may be limited under proot.** SnowLuma's hook injects into the QQ process via ptrace, and proot is itself a ptrace emulation layer — whether injection succeeds when the two stack **depends heavily on your device, kernel, and proot version** and is not guaranteed. This is the single biggest unknown of this path."],[1182,"**ptrace 注入在 proot 下可能受限。** SnowLuma 的 hook 靠 ptrace 注入 QQ 进程，而 proot 本身就是个 ptrace 模拟层——两者叠加时注入是否成功**高度取决于设备、内核与 proot 版本**，不保证可用。这是本路径最大的不确定点。"],[3077,"**QQ first, then SnowLuma**: SnowLuma finds the already-running `QQ.exe` and injects on startup."],[2151,"**QR login**: SnowLuma is **QR-scan login only** — there's no CLI login. On headless setups you must see the QQ window via VNC / noVNC to scan."],[2933,"**Resource-heavy.** QQ is a Chromium-based Electron app, plus a full Xvfb + VNC + Node stack — heavy on a phone's RAM, heat, and battery. Low-end devices won't cope."],[2717,"**Resources**: each QQ is a full Chromium process, \\~300-500 MB RAM. The default `--shm-size=1g` is fine for one; bump to `2gb`+ for multi-account."],[3079,"**Run SnowLuma as the same Windows user as QQ.** Injection needs access to the target process; if SnowLuma and QQ run under different users (or mismatched privileges), injection fails. Running one elevated (as administrator) and the other not can also block injection — keep their privileges consistent."],[2935,"**Session persistence.** Termux processes can be killed by the system's battery saver; use Termux's wake-lock and consider disabling battery optimization for the app."],[2625,"**Set your own password**: pass `VNC_PASSWD` at start. The password is rotated only when you change this value, and the new one is printed once."],[2883,"**setcap** fails on some containerized / overlay / tmpfs filesystems (see step 4)."],[1133,"**setcap** 在某些容器化 / overlay / tmpfs 文件系统上会失败（见第 4 节）。"],[3078,"**SnowLuma first, then QQ**: SnowLuma waits until `QQ.exe` appears, then injects."],[2915,"**So the realistic recommendation on mobile: Termux + proot Ubuntu, then run SnowLuma manually following the Linux (manual) flow inside it.** Docker on a phone is for tinkerers and is not recommended here."],[2017,"**Tests first** — core OneBot behavior should be validated with `vitest`; see `packages/core/tests/`."],[2426,"**Type compatibility** — consumers can share the SDK's exported types, but they are maintained independently of server code. The bundled catalog lists actions known to that SDK version; it does not probe the remote server's capabilities. Custom or dynamic actions remain available through `raw()` / `rawResponse()`."],[2054,"**TypeScript SDK** — `@snowluma/sdk`, for writing fully typed OneBot clients."],[304,"**TypeScript SDK** —— `@snowluma/sdk`，写类型完备的 OneBot 客户端。"],[3009,"**Up front: the SnowLuma Docker image is Linux.** It runs **headless Linux QQ** + Xvfb + VNC + noVNC inside the container. On Windows you run this Linux container through Docker Desktop's **WSL2 backend** — i.e. it's still running inside a lightweight Linux VM."],[2563,"**VNC Password**: if the panel asks for one, set a strong password of your own. Do not reuse a fixed value from old docs or sample posts. The official image has no public default password."],[813,"**VNC 密码**：面板若要求填写，请设成你自己的强密码，不要用旧文档或网上示例里的固定值。官方镜像本身没有公开的默认密码。"],[2719,"**WebUI lists every UIN automatically**: no manual configuration — SnowLuma surfaces each new account in the WebUI and `get_login_info` returns the new UINs once login completes."],[2564,"**WebUI Port**: default `5099`"],[814,"**WebUI 端口**：默认 `5099`"],[969,"**WebUI 自动列出所有 UIN**：SnowLuma 不需要单独配置就能识别新登录的账号，WebUI / `get_login_info` 都会出现新 UIN。"],[2936,"**Wrong arch won't run.** Use the `linux-arm64-lite` tarball and the arm64 QQ `.deb`."],[2884,"**Yama `ptrace_scope=3`** disables ptrace injection entirely."],[1134,"**Yama `ptrace_scope=3`** 会让 ptrace 注入彻底失效。"],[398,"**不是首推。** 正在 Alpha 测试，命令和默认行为都可能变。能跑 Docker 的请优先用上一节。愿意帮忙踩坑的，可以试："],[352,"**不要**把 noVNC / WebUI / OneBot 端口裸暴露在公网。Docker 的远程桌面**没有**固定默认密码，第一次启动会随机生成，只在容器日志里打印一次。"],[405,"**不要**把 noVNC / WebUI / OneBot 端口裸暴露在公网。远程桌面没有固定默认密码，看容器日志即可。"],[1243,"**不要删除数据卷**（`qq-gateway-data`、`qq-client-config`、`qq-client-data`）。删了就会丢登录态和配置。`docker rm` 只删容器、不删卷，重建时挂上同名卷即可无缝衔接。"],[1358,"**不要把 WebUI / OneBot 端口裸暴露到公网。** 这些端口能完全控制你的 QQ。如需远程访问，请走反向代理 + 鉴权或内网穿透 + 鉴权，并改掉默认凭据。"],[970,"**不要用桌面 autostart 目录**：镜像使用 `fluxbox`，不是 XFCE/GNOME 会话；`~/.config/autostart/*.desktop` 不一定会被读取。多开自启交给 supervisor 更稳。"],[264,"**不要绕过 BridgeManager**：OneBot 层一律通过 `BridgeInterface` 调用 NTQQ 能力，便于解耦和测试。"],[874,"**不设 `VNC_PASSWD`**：第一次启动会生成随机密码，**只在容器日志里打印一次**（中英各一行）。之后保存在数据卷里；重建容器或升级镜像，只要卷还在，密码不变，日志也不会再打。"],[677,"**业务与传输错误** —— SDK 的业务和传输错误类继承 `SnowLumaError`：业务失败抛 `SnowLumaApiError`（鉴权类 retcode 走 `SnowLumaAuthError`），传输层抛 `SnowLumaTransportError` 基类下的 `SnowLumaConnectionError` / `SnowLumaParseError` / `SnowLumaTimeoutError` / `SnowLumaAbortError`。本地参数校验、文件访问和部分上下文操作也可能抛出原生异常，不能只捕获 `SnowLumaError`。"],[60,"**从旧格式迁移**：早期版本把 `httpServers` / `wsServers` 等数组直接放在顶层，`httpPostEndpoints` 用于上报。当 SnowLuma 检测到这种结构时会自动迁移到新的 `networks` 对象并把 `httpPostEndpoints` 改名为 `httpClients`，回写到磁盘。手动维护配置请直接用新格式。"],[267,"**优先补测试**：核心 OneBot 行为通过 `vitest` 验证，参考 `packages/core/tests/`。"],[1185,"**会话保活。** Termux 进程可能被系统省电策略杀掉；用 Termux 的 wake-lock，并考虑关掉该 App 的电池优化。"],[1163,"**但真正的 Docker（dockerd）在 proot 下跑不起来。** proot 只是一个基于 ptrace 的系统调用模拟器，没有 namespaces / cgroups / netfilter，而这些正是容器运行时所依赖的。"],[265,"**保持配置可自动生成**：新增字段需向后兼容；解析时归一化、写回磁盘。"],[1327,"**先开 QQ 再开 SnowLuma**：SnowLuma 启动后立刻发现已在运行的 `QQ.exe` 并注入。"],[1328,"**先开 SnowLuma 再开 QQ**：SnowLuma 会等到 `QQ.exe` 出现后再注入。"],[1259,"**先说清楚：SnowLuma 的 Docker 镜像是 Linux 的。** 它在容器里跑的是**无头 Linux QQ** + Xvfb + VNC + noVNC。在 Windows 上你是通过 Docker Desktop 的 **WSL2 后端**来运行这个 Linux 容器——本质上还是在一个轻量 Linux 虚拟机里跑。"],[56,"**全局配置**：`config/onebot.json`，作为所有账号的默认值。"],[1342,"**全新数据目录首次启动**时，会在控制台 / 日志里输出一次性管理员密码。从 `launcher.bat` 弹出的控制台窗口里翻一下即可（找含“临时密码 / initial credentials”的那行）。"],[303,"**内置 WebUI** —— 浏览器里管理账号、配置、查看状态。"],[1167,"**别从 Google Play 装 Termux。** Play 商店里的版本早已停更、有已知问题。请从 **F-Droid** 或 Termux 的 GitHub Releases 安装。"],[1111,"**别把 VNC（5900）/ noVNC（6081）/ WebUI（5099）/ OneBot（3000、3001）裸暴露到公网。** 用防火墙锁到本机、走 SSH 隧道或反代加鉴权。VNC 一定要设强密码——否则你的 QQ 桌面在公网上裸奔。"],[1132,"**包名 / 路径**因发行版而异（上文按 Ubuntu 24.04）。Debian、Arch、RHEL 系的 `libasound`、X 工具、noVNC 启动器路径都不一样。"],[951,"**升级镜像不要删这三个卷**，否则会丢登录态和配置。"],[266,"**原生模块按平台分发**：新加平台时同步 `.node` 与可注入库。"],[1165,"**因此手机上的现实推荐：Termux + proot Ubuntu，然后在里面按 Linux 手动部署 流程手动跑 SnowLuma。** 手机上的 Docker 留给极客折腾，不在本页推荐范围。"],[302,"**多账号** —— 一个 UIN 一个 OneBot 实例，自动检测、自动接入，无需手动配置。"],[1312,"**完整版**，内置 Node.js 运行时，不用单独装 Node，包体较大。"],[404,"**开放端口**：要从外部访问，放行 WebUI（`5099`）和你用到的 OneBot 端口（`3000` / `3001`）。"],[1115,"**必须作用在真实二进制上**——`readlink -f` 解开 `which node` 的软链，capability 不会跟着软链走。"],[1329,"**必须用和 QQ 相同的 Windows 用户运行 SnowLuma。** 注入需要能访问目标进程；如果 SnowLuma 和 QQ 跑在不同用户（或权限不对等）下，注入会失败。如果一个以管理员身份运行、另一个没有，也可能注入不上——保持二者权限一致。"],[875,"**想用自己的密码**：启动时设置 `VNC_PASSWD`。只有你主动改这个值时才会换密码，并再打印一次。"],[401,"**扫码登录**：SnowLuma **只支持扫码登录**，没有 CLI 登录。在无头环境里必须通过 VNC / noVNC 看到 QQ 窗口才能扫码。"],[402,"**找 WebUI 临时密码**：**首次**用全新数据目录启动时，日志里会打印一次性管理员密码。Docker："],[1162,"**无 root 的 Linux 用户态在 Android 上很容易**——用 Termux + `proot-distro` 装一个 Ubuntu 即可。"],[1186,"**架构选错就跑不起来。** lite tarball 选 `linux-arm64-lite`，QQ `.deb` 选 arm64。"],[966,"**每个 QQ 实例独占自己的 `HOME`** —— 别让两个 QQ 共用同一个 `HOME`，会冲突。"],[408,"**用后即清**：密码读取后会**立即从地址栏移除**（`history.replaceState`），避免经浏览器历史 / 访问日志 / Referer 头泄露。"],[676,"**类型兼容** —— SDK 导出的动作类型可供消费端共享，但与服务端代码独立维护。包内目录代表该 SDK 版本已知的动作，不是对远端能力的探测；自定义或动态动作仍可通过 `raw()` / `rawResponse()` 调用。"],[1314,"**精简版**，不含 Node.js，需要你自己先装好 Node，体积小很多。"],[58,"**自动生成**：账号配置缺失或缺 access token 时，SnowLuma 会写入规范化后的默认配置。"],[675,"**自动重连** —— `reconnect: true`（或 `ReconnectOptions`）启用指数退避（`minDelayMs` 默认 1000，`maxDelayMs` 默认 30000）。断线时所有挂起请求会以 `SnowLumaConnectionError` 拒绝。"],[57,"**账号配置**：`config/onebot_<uin>.json`，会覆盖全局配置。"],[967,"**资源**：每个 QQ 进程跑 Chromium 大概吃 300-500MB 内存，`--shm-size` 主账号 1GB 够用，多开建议加到 `2gb` 或更高。"],[1183,"**资源吃紧。** QQ 是基于 Chromium 的 Electron 应用，外加一整套 Xvfb + VNC + Node，对手机内存 / 发热 / 电量压力很大。低端机基本带不动。"],[1117,"**需要支持 xattr 的文件系统**，某些 overlay / tmpfs 上 `setcap` 会失败。"],[316,"**预编译 tarball**"],[2635,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` and `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` are **mandatory**. SnowLuma's native addon uses ptrace to inject the hook into the QQ process; the default seccomp profile blocks that."],[3138,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` and `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` are **required** — the hook injects via ptrace, which the default seccomp profile blocks."],[2142,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` and `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` are **required**. `--shm-size=1g` is required by QQ. The remote-desktop password is generated on first start and printed once in the logs."],[3021,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` and `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` are **still required**. SnowLuma's native addon injects the hook into the container's QQ process via ptrace, which the default seccomp profile blocks. Docker Desktop's WSL2 backend passes these through to the WSL2 kernel, so they work as usual."],[2630,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` and `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` are still required."],[1388,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` **不能省**——hook 通过 ptrace 注入，默认 seccomp 会拦。"],[392,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` **不能省**：默认 seccomp 会拦住注入，QQ（Chromium）也需要 `--shm-size=1g`。远程桌面密码首次启动会随机生成，只在日志里打一次。"],[885,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` **不能省**。SnowLuma 的 native addon 通过 ptrace 把 hook 注入 QQ 进程，默认 seccomp profile 会拦截。"],[1271,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` **仍然不能省**。SnowLuma 的 native addon 通过 ptrace 把 hook 注入容器内的 QQ 进程，默认 seccomp profile 会拦截。Docker Desktop 的 WSL2 后端会把这两项透传进 WSL2 内核，所以照常工作。"],[880,"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` 仍然不能省。"],[927,"`--disable-gpu --disable-software-rasterizer --disable-gpu-compositing`"],[2677,"`--disable-gpu --disable-software-rasterizer --disable-gpu-compositing`"],[2636,"`--shm-size=1g` is needed for QQ's Chromium runtime — the default container `/dev/shm` is too small and QQ will crash."],[886,"`--shm-size=1g` 是 QQ（基于 Chromium）的运行要求，容器默认 `/dev/shm` 太小会崩。"],[3071,"`.tar.gz` can be unpacked with the built-in `tar` (shipped on Win10/11):"],[1321,"`.tar.gz` 可以用 Windows 自带的 `tar`（Win10/11 已内置）解压："],[715,"`{ file_id }`"],[2465,"`{ file_id }`"],[703,"`{ message_id }`"],[707,"`{ message_id }`"],[711,"`{ message_id }`"],[2453,"`{ message_id }`"],[2457,"`{ message_id }`"],[2461,"`{ message_id }`"],[2471,"`{ source, filename }`, to name a source without changing its bytes."],[721,"`{ source, filename }`：在不改变字节来源的情况下指定文件名。"],[2007,"`@snowluma/core` full build"],[257,"`@snowluma/core` 完整构建"],[2220,"`@snowluma/mcp` exposes SnowLuma's On